      "name": "Calibrated Prediction Interval Coverage",
      "unit": "Percentage (%)",
      "retail_meaning": "The percentage of actual future sales days that fell within MORROW's upper and lower forecast safety bounds. Calibrated empirically so operations teams can trust safety stock buffers."
    }
